OL,3,GNEWSACommunity farm delighted with
OL,4,Aroyal recognition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrincess Anne has unveiled a plaque at
OL,7,FEngland's first community-owned farm,
OL,8,Fwhich celebrates its 20th anniversary
OL,9,Fthis year.
OL,11,FFordhall Farm, near Market Drayton, was
OL,12,Fsaved from development in 2006 when
OL,13,Fbrother and sister, Charlotte and Ben
OL,14,FHollins, were able to persuade
OL,15,Fthousands of people to buy shares.
OL,17,FIt now has more than 8,000 shareholders
OL,18,Fand has plans to sell another 1,000 to
OL,19,Fmark its anniversary.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
