OL,3,GNEWSACommunity farm delighted with
OL,4,Aroyal recognition
OL,5,
OL,6,FNon-executive director, Edward Marvin,
OL,7,Fsaid the royal visit was important
OL,8,Fbecause it highlighted the work done to
OL,9,Fmake sure "small farms like Fordhall
OL,10,Fand many others can survive in the
OL,11,Ffuture".
